 [leg(U,'org:henrici',10593000,'USD','2026-03-27',D,['press:loan:0010'],'Borrower disputed; the record lists operation 612661003607 under Franede.','Prestataria en disputa; el acta registra la operación 612661003607 a nombre de Franede.'),
  leg('org:henrici',I,10593000,'USD','2026-03-27','transfer',['press:flow:0005'],'Excluded from my totals to avoid counting the Franede leg twice.','Excluido de mis totales para no contar dos veces el tramo de Franede.')],
 'The record (loan 612661003607) supports the Franede attribution. Henrici appears with a separate debt of G. 345,372 million on an unofficial debtor list, so it may have other loans not described.',
